{"game": "alien-swarm", "language": "english", "appid": 630, "month": "2015-11", "window": 1, "start_date": 1446336000, "end_date": 1446940799, "month_true_total": 90, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-06 00:59:30 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "18940351", "author": {"steamid": "76561198075009824", "personaname": "verniy-leninetz", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/vatsarev/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 228, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 153, "last_played": 1499110533, "avatar": "7f18826cde601ab69f29cb088793af9cbd1ccc14"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great co-op timekiller.\nLooks like modern co-op version of Crimsonland.", "timestamp_created": 1446934200, "timestamp_updated": 1446934200, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "18935873", "author": {"steamid": "76561198125641664", "personaname": "LUTADOR MASOQUISTA", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/eantropix/", "num_games_owned": 336, "num_reviews": 20, "playtime_forever": 328, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 265, "last_played": 1532133440, "avatar": "0ef93ab85c082b328be461ba56c6f6065766e38c"}, "language": "english", "review": "The game is really fun, hard, and kinda addicting.\n\nProblem is, there aren't a lot of people that play it :/\n", "timestamp_created": 1446920532, "timestamp_updated": 1446920532, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "18935155", "author": {"steamid": "76561197993014810", "personaname": "refurbished sexbot", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/QUEEN_ZERO/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 20010, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 19423, "last_played": 1659827539, "avatar": "264bb0ca9389e8363c941aed27e14532c631d122"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is a great game, one that valve should have supported more. There was no reason for them to leave it hanging the way they did. Some independently created maps should have been made official, and those creators should have been allowed to sell them in a marketplace like the one for other games wherein content creators have the option of selling their content, also valve should have created a few other maps of their own. \n\nThe short review of the game is this: Stellar game, Zero support, play the original map until you're tired of it, try the independent maps until their imbalances and design flaws show, then move on to something else...unless they start to support this game again.", "timestamp_created": 1446918564, "timestamp_updated": 1446918564, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "18921933", "author": {"steamid": "76561197989196727", "personaname": "GetRage", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197989196727/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 1081, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1081, "last_played": 86400, "avatar": "3aca6ed9960b0c0c875aaae68a96466ada3868c2"}, "language": "english", "review": "Love it", "timestamp_created": 1446